#: templates/adminsettings.php:246
msgid "Terrain"
msgstr "Terrain"

#: templates/adminsettings.php:562
msgid ""
"This is helpful when all of your stores are located in single country and "
"you are facing incorrect search result problems. Just select country from "
"above list."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est utile lorsque tous vos magasins sont situés dans un seul pays et "
"que vous rencontrez des problèmes de résultats de recherche incorrects. "
"Sélectionnez simplement le pays dans la liste ci-dessus."

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"This is store locator plugin which provide search stores and other "
"functionality."
msgstr ""
"C'est store locator plugin qui fournissent de recherche de magasins et "
"d'autres fonctionnalités."

#: templates/adminsettings.php:255
msgid "Title Ascending"
msgstr "Titre Ascendant"

#: templates/adminsettings.php:256
msgid "Title Descending"
msgstr "Titre Décroissant"

#: templates/adminsettings.php:25
msgid "Total item count: "
msgstr "Total nombre d'éléments: "

#: templates/adminsettings.php:230
msgid "Upload Custom Google Map Marker"
msgstr "Télécharger Carte Personnalisée Google Marqueur"

#: templates/admin.php:13
msgid ""
"Use <strong>\"[csl-search pageid=\"your store listing page id\"]\"</strong> "
"shortcode on page for displaying search widget in page where \"your store "
"listing page id\" is page id of store listing page which contains  \"[csl-"
"store-list]\" shortcode. For example, [csl-search pageid=\"5226\"] ."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez le shortcode <strong>\"[csl-search pageid=\"your store listing page "
"id\"]\"</strong> sur la page pour afficher le widget de recherche sur la "
"page où \"votre identifiant de page de liste de magasin\" est l'identifiant "
"de la page de liste de magasin qui contient Shortcode \"[csl-store-list]\". "
"Par exemple, [csl-search pageid=\"5226\"] ."

#: templates/admin.php:15
msgid ""
"Use <strong>\"[csl-store-list category=\"your category slug\"]\"</strong> "
"shortcode on page for displaying store list along with map for specific "
"category"
msgstr ""
"Utilisez le shortcode <strong>\"[csl-store-list category=\"your category "
"slug\"]\"</strong> sur la page pour afficher la liste des magasins avec la "
"carte pour une catégorie spécifique"

#: templates/admin.php:11
msgid ""
"Use <strong>\"[csl-store-list]\"</strong> shortcode on page for displaying "
"store list along with map"
msgstr ""
"Utilisez le shortcode <strong>\"[csl-store-list]\"</strong> sur la page pour "
"afficher la liste des magasins avec la carte"

#: custom-store-locator.php:177 custom-store-locator.php:194
